Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We believe in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.20,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\blur0.5\3c&H0D0A08&\c&H0D0A08&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}The Summit
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.20,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\bord0\blur0.6\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}The Summit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, they've really done it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What isn't good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with the bunnies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to run, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running again? Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywhere, as long as\Nit's far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there's about to be\Nan avalanche, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol and his men have\Ncome back to the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton headed up to Bighorn to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who can fight, grab a\Nweapon and head to Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your weapons and head for Bighorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow Dalton all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow Dalton to Bighorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waple's back on the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone arm yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to protect our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,March to Bighorn! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.23,0:03:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Phoebe,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you sure we're going\Nin the right direction
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get to this Gyasta\Ntown where the witch is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you mention it, I'm\Nnot exactly sure where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're in pretty bad\Nshape if you're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, if Luffy and Sanji\Nmanage to make it to the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the doctor isn't there,\Nthey'll just turn around and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make it to the\Nplace, find the doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and tell her to go back up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami is running out of\Ntime pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I realize that, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you realize that,\Nthen do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a princess, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't snap my fingers\Nand make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a princess, not a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what? Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go ahead and\Ntake a look at the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.47,0:03:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's snow covering everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, if we keep to this route,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should see a sign for this\Npiasta place somewhere along it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.48,0:03:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll watch for signs of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'll miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen closely, citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything in this country can be\Nmade into my snack if I want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I am a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I'm great?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kurumaiimo, explain to them the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest man in this country\Nbecause you are the king, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I want to eat a house, I\Nexpect it to be served to my liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some information for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have received a report that\Nsome of the Straw Hat brats very
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inconsiderately set out for Drum Castle\Nafter they arrived on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that they took a sick woman\Nup the mountain to see her doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a dumb idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one lives there now,\Nespecially not a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, I actually heard that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha, also very inconsiderately,\Nis currently living in Drum Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a crazy old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman is living in my castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare she mock me in such a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eat her up along with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, we're going back to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He caught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to see you dead, so\Nthat really suits me just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just entered your own king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be difficult to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we live in an advanced\Nmedical nation with almost two
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dozen well-qualified doctors\Nto service his every need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 MDs emergency medical unit,\Nprepare! Heel, heel! Start operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:06:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scalpel, needle, thin, and hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure I was going to\Ndie for a minute there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a perfect\Nexample of our situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You receive all the medical\Nattention that you could possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need while your citizens have\Nto suffer without a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wrong. It's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still your king, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll shut your mouth if\Nyou know what's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us, including you, were in\Nthe highest position among Waple's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were his loyal servants,\Nor have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that while you were\Nmaking our people suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or all I could do is stand there as one of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waple's men and watch as\Nyou ruined our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to accept responsibility for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Wapol, let's leave\Nthis country together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stay in the land\Nwe betrayed any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Dalton, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one in the\Ngovernment who tried to protect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who fought for us\Nwhile he was destroying the kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stood up for us! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have died, Dalton,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and your post is captain of the\NDrum Kingdom Security Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you all survived\Nin this country without any doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our country is internationally acknowledged\Nfor its development in medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that renown is nothing\Nmore than a cheap charade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one could guess that there\Nare actually only 20 doctors
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who were shut up doing\Nresearch in the King's own lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that all the other doctors\Nhave been exiled from the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leaving the citizens to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who gets sick or injured must come\Nand beg for their life if they want help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I feel like it, maybe\NI'll lend them the Issie 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they want to stay alive and healthy,\Nall they have to do is obey me, their king!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, no one will\Ndare challenge my rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is the perfect\Nway to govern a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't real governing, Wapol,\Nand you aren't a real king!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you certainly\Nspeak your mind, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to shoot your former captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As usual, you don't\Nunderstand a thing I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I served your father before\Nyou And he was always
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a good man and a fair\Nruler I hoped you might
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come to resemble him one\Nday But I see now that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that was a lot of wishful\Nthinking Not good,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's using the ox ox fruit\NHe's in his bison form
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't back down. Just fire him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't hit him He just dodges\NNo mercy, even to my ex-soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fiddle-Bam, attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the kind of power the\NZone-type Devil Fruit will give?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it with you\Npathetic so-called rulers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There can be no hope for a\Ncountry where the king and his men
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are the first ones to abandon the\Npeople during a time of crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how well you do\Nfighting against the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let us fight with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to protect our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I've known you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what your weaknesses are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, why did you shield\Nus from that shot? Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.47,0:09:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I knew where\Nyour weak spot was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice guys always finish last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a fitting death, huh boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to go any\Nfurther in this deep snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like we've gone\Npartially up the mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is the ground shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inevitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 25,631, 32, 25,633.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all that rumbling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,25,634!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.57,0:10:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, those stupid overgrown\Nbuddies, I'm gonna kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get away from all this snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is that the\Nfirst priority is Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:11:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the second priority is Nami,\Nand the third priority is Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect her, even if it kills you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head for that cliff! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get as high\Nup as we possibly can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it up here just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't high enough, Mubi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good. Now\Nwhat? Oh, right. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab a hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we don't sink in the snow, we're\Njust gonna keep flying down this mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless we do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we were almost to\Nthe base of the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just feet away from the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you need to come up with\Na way to stop all this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.91,0:12:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all because of those damn bunnies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time I see them, I'm gonna\Nturn them into a big bowl of stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, rabbit stew?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we can do at the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slide faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is their problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.69,0:12:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.89,0:13:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't crash into that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one in charge of\Nkeeping Nami safe right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies get treated gently,\Nso you take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing got me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you do something\Nlike that, warn me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:13:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole village will be swallowed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, Kurimanimo, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robson! Serious Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cape, sir, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let us ride too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.99,0:14:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.27,0:14:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can all find your own way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robson, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's closing in on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise, Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we get buried by this,\NI'll be able to save you, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others headed\Nup in that direction, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think the avalanche could\Nhave already gotten to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I'm sure you're cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, hang on to this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.31,0:16:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was you guys in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it had such a disgusting taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let them get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about them, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who do you mean by them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told me earlier that some of the Straw
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hats headed up the\Nmountain toward my castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a grudge against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still mad about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they climbed up there\Nand started an avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, they were the ones who caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those sinister Straw Hat\Npirates caused the avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, boys, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.29,0:17:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see if those\Nstupid sea-loving sailors
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know anything about fighting in the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you there, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the brats up ahead, Wapol, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.45,0:18:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll make you pay,\Nyou damn Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.59,0:19:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of\Nmaking it easy for you and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those half-dead friends of\Nyours to get away from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.61,0:19:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chess, I've thought up a\Nnew law to celebrate my return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Write this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who ignores the\Nking will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those three are guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chess, Korimai-mo, I want them\Nto be punished immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.03,0:19:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal with the two unconscious ones first,\Nsince they're ignoring me them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the woman on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for Marmo surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen Luffy, I don't want you\Nfighting these guys, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami will be able to\Nfeel every move you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.63,0:20:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too sick to be able to\Nhandle something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.49,0:20:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret this\Nlater, don't follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time he learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a battle in the snow is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.21,0:20:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've already given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what a snow battle's really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.87,0:21:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow powder makeup, the white disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.35,0:21:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are so incredibly weak\Nthat just one shot should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's checkmate. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polar bears?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loppins!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.67,0:21:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did those things just protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loppins never form bonds with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.05,0:21:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nothing more than wild beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.35,0:21:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those stupid\Nbunnies doing standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.93,0:22:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.07,0:22:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tall and straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the doctor's up there,\Nso I gotta climb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.99,0:23:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, nami and sanji there's\Njust a little further to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.57,0:23:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.57,0:23:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The avalanche it must have buried us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are us up come on now\Nwake up you've got to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.31,0:24:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive, I'm going to get\Nyou out of there who stop, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang on a bit longer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on us up, please just\Nwake up Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.49,0:24:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a few more\Nminutes here, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in the middle of\Nsuch a lovely dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.67,0:24:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in a world far away from\Nhere, sitting in a field of flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.49,0:24:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a beautiful river flowing next to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.55,0:24:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.46,0:24:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crossing over into\Nthe afterlife, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.93,0:24:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to get out of that dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.39,0:24:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.81,0:24:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, look at the Usopp\Npirates, all 74,000 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.35,0:24:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're such good, brave warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.07,0:24:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, get up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.21,0:24:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.37,0:24:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.31,0:24:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.73,0:24:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.79,0:24:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was almost a goner there for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.81,0:25:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.85,0:25:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.03,0:25:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except that my face feels kind of swollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.45,0:25:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.36,0:25:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.28,0:25:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.19,0:25:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an unfortunate side\Neffect of a snowy area.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.13,0:25:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.04,0:25:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the cold or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.96,0:25:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What matters now is figuring out\Nwhere we are and what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.65,0:25:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any lip balm or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.51,0:25:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like I dreamed\Nabout a field of flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.13,0:25:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit by an avalanche in the\Nmiddle of a training session.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.87,0:25:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly an ideal workout, but I guess\Nit is kind of like swimming in snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.59,0:25:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.50,0:25:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Vivi. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.55,0:25:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.15,0:25:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing all\Nthe way out here in the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.51,0:25:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what we\Nwere going to ask you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.85,0:25:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, you stupid buddies!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.61,0:26:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pathetic creatures got exactly what\Nyou deserve for going up against the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it annoys me that I had\Nto expend so much of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.27,0:26:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my power against a pack\Nof overgrown rabbits!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.99,0:26:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no helping it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.63,0:26:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the fiercest\Nanimals in Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.09,0:26:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.17,0:26:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.85,0:27:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.51,0:27:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.71,0:27:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.79,0:27:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winter swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.27,0:27:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was the idea anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.57,0:27:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after swimming in the river for a\Nwhile, I had no idea where I was anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.23,0:27:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I started walking around doing\Nsome strength training workouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.41,0:27:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dressed like that in cold weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.45,0:27:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're real stupid, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.85,0:27:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.89,0:27:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now would you shut up and\Ngive me your coat, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.89,0:27:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.33,0:27:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Nami's sick from the mental\Nexhaustion of dealing with these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.51,0:27:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how about your shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.91,0:27:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.82,0:27:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one, then! I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.95,0:27:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did this to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.07,0:27:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.03,0:27:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some people over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.51,0:27:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.17,0:27:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at those buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.15,0:27:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem familiar, don't they? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.65,0:28:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.77,0:28:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.47,0:28:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.03,0:28:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks a lot different\Nburied in snow, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.79,0:28:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.73,0:28:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd take more than a couple\Nflimsy arrows to kill hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.45,0:28:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're his men, or used to be at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.73,0:28:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you care at all about\Nwhat happens to Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.13,0:28:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all Waple's soldiers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.99,0:28:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And any one of you who opposes\NWapol is as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.05,0:28:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.45,0:28:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.37,0:28:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait what's going on with you\Nwhy are you dressed like that
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton is buried under the snow\Nthat came down with the avalanche
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what Dalton's under that that's\Nright and we can't get over
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.67,0:28:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there to take him out because\Nthose guys are blocking us for
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.01,0:28:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the last time stay back but if\Nyou really want to take your
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.99,0:28:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friend up i guess you can go\Nahead and try fighting us all hey
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who's up i think i remember\Ntheir clothing those are the same
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:29:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exact guys who attacked our ship\Nwhen we were out in the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.63,0:29:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right oh yeah that's\Nright then they're the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.61,0:29:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enemy bad guys not our friends you follow
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.47,0:29:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me yeah but wait a second i know that look
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.55,0:29:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you aren't so brave without Dalton around?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.33,0:29:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Zoro! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.39,0:29:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.71,0:29:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.29,0:29:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing good will come\Nfrom attacking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.61,0:29:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.53,0:29:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really like this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.33,0:29:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you wanted\Nto know who they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.87,0:29:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.01,0:29:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't look very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.37,0:29:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.28,0:29:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were on the ship with that guy\Nwho beat up Wapol, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.91,0:29:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.87,0:29:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a little slow, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.61,0:30:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.51,0:30:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.45,0:30:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.85,0:30:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.17,0:31:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:32:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.81,0:32:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.81,0:32:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.43,0:32:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.63,0:32:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EW!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.29,0:33:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.20,0:33:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young, the antibodies\Nseem to be responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.99,0:33:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, as I guess they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.93,0:33:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treatment worked, but what\Nwas the cause of the illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.43,0:33:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kestia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.11,0:33:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kestia, that's exactly correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.47,0:33:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you go and attend the girl, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.79,0:33:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.99,0:34:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.01,0:34:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

